ent-ModSuitModuleStorageNormal = R.I.G. storage module
    .desc = A set of compartments and pockets built into the suit. Every R.I.G. leaves the factory with one installed.
ent-ModSuitModuleStorageExpanded = R.I.G. expanded storage module
    .desc = Hidden compartments spread across the whole suit, with much more room than the standard storage.
ent-ModSuitModuleStorageSyndie = R.I.G. syndicate storage module
    .desc = A storage system by Cybersun Industries that compresses the items put inside it.
ent-ModSuitModuleJetpackNormal = R.I.G. ion jetpack module
    .desc = Electric thrusters across the suit that accelerate ions using charge from the suit's cell instead of burning gas.
ent-ModSuitModuleMagboots = R.I.G. magnetic stability module
    .desc = Powerful electromagnets fitted into the boots of the suit.
ent-ModSuitModuleMobility = R.I.G. enhanced mobility module
    .desc = Servos in the joints of the suit that help its wearer move faster, at the cost of a lot of power.
ent-ModSuitModuleInsulation = R.I.G. insulation module
    .desc = Insulated lining for the gauntlets of the suit. Works while they are sealed.
ent-ModSuitModuleVisionWelding = R.I.G. welding protection module
    .desc = A polarized overlay in front of the eyes that protects them from welding and bright flashes. Works while the helmet is sealed.
ent-BaseModSuitModuleVision = { ent-BaseModSuitModuleAction }
    .desc = { ent-BaseModSuitModuleAction.desc }
ent-ModSuitModuleVisionMed = R.I.G. medical visor module
    .desc = A biological scanning suite in the helmet that shows the health of living beings around the wearer.
ent-ModSuitModuleVisionDiagnostic = R.I.G. diagnostic visor module
    .desc = Sensors in the helmet that show the integrity of machines, cyborgs and exosuits.
ent-ModSuitModuleVisionSec = R.I.G. security visor module
    .desc = A targeting system connected to the criminal records, showing jobs, mindshields and the status of the people around.
ent-ModSuitModuleVisionMeson = R.I.G. meson visor module
    .desc = Meson scanner technology built into the helmet, revealing pipes and cables under the floor.
ent-ModSuitModuleVisionNight = R.I.G. night vision module
    .desc = Light amplifiers in the helmet that let the wearer see in complete darkness.
